ndemic seriously  is a must coco tested positive for covet  19  back in the spring and experience some  pretty bad  symptoms all documented on keeping up  with the kardashians of course  the coughing my chest would burn when i  would cough  and i mean i still my throat is still  not fully recovered clearly let me tell  you  that is real but  we're all gonna get through this praying  if we follow orders and listen we're all  gonna  be okay and while the famous fam has  seemingly scaled back during the 2020  pandemic  they've also caught some heat for  hosting large gatherings  like kendall's halloween themed birthday  bash and kim's 40th birthday getaway  she flew a group of family and friends  to a private island to celebrate  entering a new decade of life  it was such a beautiful experience and i  want kim to focus on just how beautiful  it was and what she did for everybody i  mean  i don't want that to overshadow chloe  responded to the backlash during an  appearance on the ellen degeneres show  this year is a frustrating year i get it  i think there's  so many frustrations going on for  everybody  but also it's her 40th and this is  something that she really wanted to do  for us it was such a nice thing

